* Historical 16-FF double-bank controller for read-margin regression only.
* Extracted from the saved 2026-09-11 review netlist; never a production source.
* Other subcircuits and top-level devices match the 2026-09-12 current netlist.
.subckt sram_serial_controller CLK RESET SDI WE SOUT RA CA DIN PREB WRITE_EN WL_EN SAE SDO VDD VSS
*.ipin CLK
*.ipin RESET
*.opin PREB
*.opin WL_EN
*.opin WRITE_EN
*.opin SAE
*.ipin SDI
*.opin DIN
*.opin CA
*.opin RA
*.ipin WE
*.ipin SOUT
*.opin SDO
*.iopin VDD
*.iopin VSS
xnext0 VDD NEXT0 C0B COUNT_RUN VSS AND2_X1
xcnt0 VDD C0B NEXT0 C0 RESET VSS CLK DFFR
xtoggle1 VDD net1 C1 C0 VSS XOR2
xnext1 VDD NEXT1 net1 COUNT_RUN VSS AND2_X1
xcnt1 VDD C1B NEXT1 C1 RESET VSS CLK DFFR
xtoggle2 VDD net2 C2 CARRY2 VSS XOR2
xnext2 VDD NEXT2 net2 COUNT_RUN VSS AND2_X1
xcnt2 VDD C2B NEXT2 C2 RESET VSS CLK DFFR
xtoggle3 VDD net3 C3 CARRY3 VSS XOR2
xnext3 VDD NEXT3 net3 COUNT_RUN VSS AND2_X1
xcnt3 VDD C3B NEXT3 C3 RESET VSS CLK DFFR
xcarry2 VDD CARRY2 C0 C1 VSS AND2_X1
xcarry3 C2 VDD CARRY3 C0 C1 VSS AND3_X1
xupper VDD net4 C1 C2 VSS OR2
xrun VDD COUNT_RUN C3 net4 VSS NAND2
xdecode0 C0 C1 VDD E0 C3B C2B VSS AND4_X1
xdecode1 C0B C1B VDD E1 C3B C2 VSS AND4_X1
xdecode2 C0 C1B VDD E2 C3B C2 VSS AND4_X1
